Route2_Text_Trigger1_1::
	.string "ASHLEE: Yeah, this DIGLETT will be\n"
	.string "a fine addition to our party,\l"
	.string "don’t you think PIKACHU?\p"
	.string "Imagine it...\n"
	.string "We could DIG a lot of tunnels to\l"
	.string "get inside of banks and stuff...\p"
	.string "Taking it from that kid was soooo\n"
	.string "easy...\p"
	.string "This is more entertaining than\n"
	.string "catching POKéMON in the wild...\l"
	.string "Hahaha!$"

Route2_Text_Trigger1_2::
	.string "ASHLEE: What?\p"
	.string "I captured this POKéMON fair and\n"
	.string "square!$"

Route2_Text_Trigger1_3::
	.string "ASHLEE: You overheard our\n"
	.string "conversation?\p"
	.string "Didn’t your parents ever teach you\n"
	.string "that’s not nice?\p"
	.string "Oh, damn. My trick failed...\p"
	.string "Then we’ve got no choice.\n"
	.string "Let’s go PIKACHU!$"

Route2_Text_Trigger1Defeat::
	.string "No...$"

Route2_Text_Trigger1Victory::
	.string "YES!$"

Route2_Text_Trigger1_4::
	.string "ASHLEE: All right, I’ll give you the\n"
	.string "DIGLETT.\l"
	.string "It wasn’t that useful after all.\p"
	.string "But, I’ll keep trying, or else my\n"
	.string "name ain’t ASHLEE, the world’s\l"
	.string "greatest thief!\p"
	.string "Let’s do our escape, PIKACHU!$"

